These PNG files are a cache of the club crests Squiggle publishes with its club list.
They are here so Footy Cheat can draw a crest before that download has been stored.

The crests are trademarks of the clubs. The GPL-3.0-or-later licence on the rest of
Footy Cheat does not cover these files. Caching them follows Squiggle's request that
clients keep a copy instead of asking again for the same data. A club that is not in
this set is downloaded from Squiggle the next time the library updates.
